  <History Date="10-04-06" Author="Ed Spencer" Comment="Moved Rainbow to effect group" />
  <History Date="24-05-06" Author="Ed" Comment="Added virtual dimmer and new mode to use it" />
  <History Date="13-07-06" Author="Ed" Comment="Removed non vDim mode and added modes 4 and 8" />
  <History Date="02-02-09" Author="D4 Personality Fixer 2009" Comment="Changed Function Names" />
  <History Date="30-03-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Updated fixture type from nothing to fixed" />
  <History Date="19-04-12" Author="Locate Fix" Comment="Updated locate, power on, highlight and lowlight values to valid values" />
  <History Date="11-02-14" Author="RGB Power on Updater" Comment="Updated RGB Power on values to match Locate." />
  <History Date="15-04-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added pixel mapper compatibility.  Added mode 1.  Added palettes." />
  <History Date="01-06-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed virtual dimmer (previously was set to no resolution which is no longer compatible)" />
  <History Date="15-09-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Showtec PixelTrack" />
